.com/users/Fury03","html_url":"https://github.com/Fury03","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fury03/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":42,"closed_issues":122,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-08-24T10:10:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T10:55:18Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-24T20:55:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T20:03:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"sojetunde8","id":287985093,"node_id":"U_kgDOESpNxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287985093?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8","html_url":"https://github.com/sojetunde8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojetunde8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> Backlog entry `#247`, from **[docs/backlog.md](https://github.com/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/blob/main/docs/backlog.md)** — Cross-cutting — UI, UX and visual design / I5 — Accessibility and motion.\n\n## What\n\n`render()` replaces `#out.innerHTML` with no live region, so a screen-reader user gets no indication that anything happened.\n\n## Roadmap impact\n\n**V1 — Hardening** — I5 — Accessibility and motion.\n\n## Constraints that apply\n\n**The semantic boundary.** You decide how a state *looks*. The measurement\nengine and the check contract decide *when it fires*. Colour, layout, copy,\nmotion and interaction are yours; verdict thresholds, integrity semantics and\ncheck semantics are not.\n\n- never display a figure the engine did not produce — no fabricated data,\n  history, routes, benchmarks or predictions\n- UNDETERMINED is not failure and must not be styled as failure\n- DIRECT / DERIVATIVE / NO-MARKET are structural states, not severities\n- no build step: `server/index.html` is one file, embedded in the binary\n\nIf this work needs a field the API does not expose, stop — that is a backend\ndata-contract issue first, and this one depends on it.\n\n## Done when\n\n- [ ] the behaviour is in place in `server/index.html`, with no build step added\n- [ ] it works in light and dark, and at 320 / 375 / 768 / 1024 / 1440\n- [ ] it is keyboard reachable and does not rely on colour alone\n- [ ] every state it can render was checked against a real API response,\n      including the undetermined and stale ones\n\n---\n\nScope and acceptance criteria may be sharpened in the comments before work starts — say so in a comment if you are picking this up. If the work turns out to require changing verdict thresholds, integrity semantics, the check composition rule or the run-record layout, stop and flag it: that is a different issue with a different review bar.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/issues/302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayfare-labs/wayfare/issues/302/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}